("Water, leaks and plumbing","Basic","🚰","Find shutoffs and investigate moisture promptly before damage spreads.",[("Shutoff","Locate main and fixture valves","Kitchen sink isolation"),("Leak signs","Stains, soft materials or unexplained usage","Ceiling discoloration"),("Escalation","Active leak requires containment and qualified help","Shut off water if safe")],"If a supply line leaks, isolate water if safe, document damage, and arrange a plumber.","Should a slow hidden leak wait until annual service?","No. Moisture can cause increasing damage; investigate promptly.","Photograph and label accessible shutoffs.",["EPA mold","CSLB hiring"],["Spot leak","Contain","Call help","Dry/check"]),
